sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (browser)
    participant W as Next.js (Vercel)
    participant A as NestJS API (Railway)
    participant S as sessions (PostgreSQL)
    participant R as RBAC guard
    participant DB as Tenant data (RLS)

    U->>W: enter credentials
    W->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/login (email, password)
    A->>S: verify user, Argon2id check
    A->>S: create session row
    A-->>W: Set-Cookie (HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite) + CSRF token
    W-->>U: authenticated shell

    Note over U,DB: subsequent request
    U->>W: action
    W->>A: GET/POST /api/v1/... (cookie + CSRF on mutations)
    A->>S: load session -> user_id, tenant_id
    A->>A: resolve TenantContext (never from body)
    A->>R: @RequirePermission(module.resource.action)
    R->>R: roles x scope (tenant/branch/dept/team/self)
    alt permitted
        A->>DB: BEGIN; SET LOCAL app.tenant_id/app.user_id/app.role_scope
        A->>DB: query with tenant_id + scope filter (RLS also enforces)
        DB-->>A: rows
        A-->>W: 200 + correlation id
    else denied
        A-->>W: 403 AUTH_FORBIDDEN + correlation id
    end
